{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":21.1200008392334,"text":"Small ankle bones from sheep and goats, the most widespread game of the ancient world. Each bone has four different sides, each with its own name and score, so it works like a dice that is not fair. Children threw them up and caught them on the back of the hand, or aimed to knock one with another. They turn up in excavations in their thousands.","words":[{"word":"Small","start":0,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"ankle","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1.2799999713897705},{"word":"bones","start":1.2799999713897705,"end":1.5},{"word":"from","start":1.5,"end":1.8600000143051147},{"word":"sheep","start":1.8600000143051147,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"and","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"goats","start":2.640000104904175,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"the","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3},{"word":"most","start":3,"end":3.359999895095825},{"word":"widespread","start":3.359999895095825,"end":3.7200000286102295},{"word":"game","start":3.7200000286102295,"end":4.099999904632568},{"word":"of","start":4.099999904632568,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"the","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.460000038146973},{"word":"ancient","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.659999847412109},{"word":"world","start":4.659999847412109,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"Each","start":5.739999771118164,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"bone","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"has","start":6.139999866485596,"end":6.440000057220459},{"word":"four","start":6.440000057220459,"end":6.760000228881836},{"word":"different","start":6.760000228881836,"end":7.139999866485596},{"word":"sides","start":7.139999866485596,"end":7.5},{"word":"each","start":8.140000343322754,"end":8.180000305175781},{"word":"with","start":8.180000305175781,"end":8.399999618530273},{"word":"its","start":8.399999618530273,"end":8.579999923706055},{"word":"own","start":8.579999923706055,"end":8.85